minus runner-up, of `k = 100`:

    step      0    64   128   256   384   448   496   508   510   511
    seed 82 100    97    98    95    98    93    94    29     4     3
    seed 85  98   100    98    96    95   100    92     1     1     3
    seed 88  97    97   100    95    93    96    92    20     0     0

